flowchart RL
  subgraph hire [Recruiting]
    direction RL
    s1[Job posting] --> b1[Applications]
    s2[Referrals] --> b1
    s3[Internal mobility] --> b2[Transfer requests]
  end
  subgraph select [Selection]
    b1 --> sv1[Interviews]
    b2 --> sv2[Manager approval]
    sv1 & sv2 --> g1[Offer letter]
    sv2 --> g2[Team assignment]
  end
  subgraph onboard [Onboarding]
    g1 --> d1[Contract signed] & d2[Welcome day]
    g2 --> m1[Training plan] --> d1
  end
  d2 -.->|feedback| s1
  m1 --> m1
